#
# The relibc (Redox's Rust libc, MIT) tree userspace/lib/relibc-azos is an
# overlay and a patch for. Fixed on 2026-10-13, owner-approved download.
#
# `tag` is empty on purpose: upstream cut its last tag (0.6.0) in 2020, a tree
# of nightly-2020 Rust, core_io and ralloc that has nothing in common with the
# current library, so the pin is a commit of `master` (version 0.2.5 in its
# Cargo.toml, committed 2026-10-11). Changing it is a re-port: the patch in
# userspace/lib/relibc-azos/patches must apply to the new tree and the host
# C programs must link again.
#
# Read by tools/relibc_fetch.sh (what to fetch), tools/relibc_build.sh (what to
# patch) and tools/lx_license_lint.py --relibc-pin (the checkout must be it).
url=https://gitlab.redox-os.org/redox-os/relibc.git
tag=
commit=da81004e74fdbd613704c1aaf2384749ac987ec1
# The one submodule the build needs (the allocator). openlibm, the C math
# library, is not fetched: the build uses relibc's own `math_libm` feature.
dlmalloc_url=https://gitlab.redox-os.org/redox-os/dlmalloc-rs.git
dlmalloc_commit=40c10f6182cb1d2a78b29f85492936dfbeded02e
